[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13081.19, "timestamp": "03:38:01", "text": "关于。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13084.07, "timestamp": "03:38:04", "text": "哇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13087.03, "timestamp": "03:38:07", "text": "我以前从不知道这件事。等等，是那位电子教师。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13091.429, "timestamp": "03:38:11", "text": "等等，什么？ WHO？不，并非如此。不，不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13093.75, "timestamp": "03:38:13", "text": "我只是随口说说而已。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13105.67, "timestamp": "03:38:25", "text": "顺便说一句，食人行为……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13108.95, "timestamp": "03:38:28", "text": "在各种气候条件下均有效"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13112.389, "timestamp": "03:38:32", "text": "就像昆虫也能做到那样，但没什么大不了的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13117.11, "timestamp": "03:38:37", "text": "交易。但就像高级生物一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13120.15, "timestamp": "03:38:40", "text": "人类和哺乳动物不会同类相食。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13125.51, "timestamp": "03:38:45", "text": "因为我觉得这存在局限性。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13127.83, "timestamp": "03:38:47", "text": "在那里，你无法像消化自己一样消化自己"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13131.51, "timestamp": "03:38:51", "text": "事物。所以，我们的身体天生就不适合这种环境。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13136.55, "timestamp": "03:38:56", "text": "吃自己的肉。是的，你会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13138.55, "timestamp": "03:38:58", "text": "大概就这么死了吧。如果你愿意"}]